      en: ["Built in honor of the poet Nizami Ganjavi (1141–1209).", "The current monumental building was inaugurated in 1991.", "The structure reaches a total height of 20 meters.", "High-quality granite and white marble were used for construction.", "Surrounded by sculptures depicting scenes from his poems.", "Located on the eastern outskirts of Ganja in a large park."],
